WEBVTT

00:00:00.553 --> 00:00:02.266
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What time</b> did you <b>get up</b>?

00:00:05.906 --> 00:00:07.719
<v><b>B:</b></v> I <b>got up</b> at <b>7.30</b>.

00:00:11.222 --> 00:00:12.886
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you <b>have breakfast</b>?

00:00:16.386 --> 00:00:17.347
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, I <b>did</b>.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.170
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What</b> did you <b>have</b>?

00:00:25.659 --> 00:00:27.668
<v><b>B:</b></v> I <b>had toast</b> and <b>coffee</b>.

00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:32.713
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What</b> did you do <b>then</b>?

00:00:36.225 --> 00:00:37.239
<v><b>B:</b></v> I <b>went</b> to <b>work</b>.